# Input
```svelte
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->
<input type="file" accept="image/jpg" />
<input {...props} type="file" accept="image/jpg" />

```

# Diagnostics
```
invalid.svelte:2:28 lint/nursery/noInvalidFileInputAccept  FIXABLE  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × Use image/jpeg as the file input accept value.
  
    1 │ <!-- should generate diagnostics -->
  > 2 │ <input type="file" accept="image/jpg" />
      │                            ^^^^^^^^^
    3 │ <input {...props} type="file" accept="image/jpg" />
    4 │ 
  
  i File input accept values must contain comma-separated filename extensions or valid MIME types.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Unsafe fix: Use the normalized file input accept value.
  
    1 1 │   <!-- should generate diagnostics -->
    2   │ - <input·type="file"·accept="image/jpg"·/>
      2 │ + <input·type="file"·accept="image/jpeg"·/>
    3 3 │   <input {...props} type="file" accept="image/jpg" />
    4 4 │   
  

```

